WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:26.795
Every search condition matches. Enough?

00:00:26.795 --> 00:00:59.792
The query represents the information need

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:36.170
A skilled strategy expresses more

00:01:36.170 --> 00:02:16.703
Same study. Different contribution.

00:02:16.703 --> 00:02:45.353
Search and judgement improve each other

00:02:45.353 --> 00:03:16.629
Some criteria belong in screening

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:49.800
Four perspectives, without a fixed ladder
